{"id":"8adbccc4211045f3","group":"91","path":"91/91-prop-fixed-point-semantics.md","title":"一致固定点中的真理原子读码与透明性","display":"prop-fixed-point-semantics — 一致固定点中的真理原子读码与透明性","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-prop-fixed-point-semantics","aliases":["91-prop-fixed-point-semantics","91-prop-fp-semantics","91-prop-kripke-semantics"],"display":"prop-fixed-point-semantics — 一致固定点中的真理原子读码与透明性","depends_on":["[[91-df-fixed-point-model]]","[[91-df-truth-value-function]]","[[91-df-jump-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-prop-fixed-point-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-prop-fixed-point-semantics</span><span>91-prop-fp-semantics</span><span>91-prop-kripke-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-fixed-point-semantics — 一致固定点中的真理原子读码与透明性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f276735320c6ad44\" href=\"?note=f276735320c6ad44\" title=\"91-df-fixed-point-model\">91-df-fixed-point-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2bc1263010e83604\" href=\"?note=2bc1263010e83604\" title=\"91-df-truth-value-function\">91-df-truth-value-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\">\\(X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"J\">\\(J\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" href=\"?note=ae9eced0b12cbd2a\" title=\"91-df-jump-operator\">91-df-jump-operator</a> 的单步正算子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_X\">\\(v_X\\)</span> 是其一致强 Kleene 固定点评估。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X^-=\\{a\\in C_T:\\operatorname{neg}(a)\\in X\\}\">\\(X^-=\\{a\\in C_T:\\operatorname{neg}(a)\\in X\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\\quad\nv_X(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}))=\n\\begin{cases}\\mathbf t&amp;\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X,\\\\\n\\mathbf f&amp;\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X,\\\\\n\\mathbf u&amp;\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin X\\land\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin X,\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad v_X(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}))=v_X(\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\\quad\nv_X(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}))=\n\\begin{cases}\\mathbf t&amp;\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X,\\\\\n\\mathbf f&amp;\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X,\\\\\n\\mathbf u&amp;\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin X\\land\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin X,\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad v_X(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}))=v_X(\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>读码部分来自正/反外延对，透明性再使用固定点定理。旧未定义 J_SK 现直接接到原书 J，避免把各阶段不同的单步与递归跳跃混同。\n此结论使用一致性排除重叠，不能套到允许过剩的全部代数固定点。经典闭包的 ¬Tφ 真也不自动表示三值模型中 φ 假。</p>\n<p>来源：Lemmas 15.13–15.14，印刷页 195–196，PDF 页 206–207；Theorem 15.15。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-fixed-point-model","status":"resolved","id":"f276735320c6ad44","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-fixed-point-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-value-function","status":"resolved","id":"2bc1263010e83604","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-value-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-jump-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-jump-operator","status":"resolved","id":"ae9eced0b12cbd2a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)$，$J$ 是 [[91-df-jump-operator]] 的单步正算子，$v_X$ 是其一致强 Kleene 固定点评估。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in\\operatorname{Fix}_c(J)","display":false},{"tex":"J","display":false},{"tex":"v_X","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"X^-=\\{a\\in C_T:\\operatorname{neg}(a)\\in X\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point\\text{-}semantics}\\vdash\\quad\nv_X(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}))=\n\\begin{cases}\\mathbf t&\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X,\\\\\n\\mathbf f&\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\in X,\\\\\n\\mathbf u&\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin X\\land\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner\\notin X,\n\\end{cases}\n\\qquad v_X(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}))=v_X(\\varphi).","display":true}],"bytes":1622,"backlinks":[{"id":"eb8ec521f1c6bc18","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-181","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-fixed-point-semantics]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-180","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-prop-fixed-point-semantics]]"}],"outgoing":["f276735320c6ad44","2bc1263010e83604","ae9eced0b12cbd2a"]}